### 1. 统一下单（模拟渠道）
POST http://localhost:8080/openapi/pay/unifiedorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M100001",
  "appId": "APP100001",
  "outTradeNo": "T20261106001",
  "amount": 8888,
  "subject": "蓝牙耳机",
  "channel": "MOCK"
}

> 再点一次「Send」，paymentNo 不变 —— 这就是幂等

### 2. 参数校验（金额为 0，应返回 1001）
POST http://localhost:8080/openapi/pay/unifiedorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M100001",
  "appId": "APP100001",
  "outTradeNo": "T20261106009",
  "amount": 0,
  "subject": "测试",
  "channel": "MOCK"
}

### 3. 查询支付单
GET http://localhost:8080/openapi/pay/query/{{paymentNo}}

### 4. 模拟渠道回调（把支付单改成成功）
POST http://localhost:8080/notify/mock
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

paymentNo={{paymentNo}}&tradeNo=MOCK_DEMO_001

### 5. 商户号与应用不匹配（应返回 2000）
POST http://localhost:8080/openapi/pay/unifiedorder
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantNo": "M999999",
  "appId": "APP100001",
  "outTradeNo": "T20261106010",
  "amount": 100,
  "subject": "测试",
  "channel": "MOCK"
}
